                          "SYMMETRIC weak-isospin T3=±1/2 (self-dual SU(2)+, N4 U1 LOCATED: CKM arc 2026-06-23 + parity exclusion 2026-06-28), common Y/2=+1/6; distinct from (but linked to) the CP handedness",
